   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Aşağıdaki periyodik tablo kesitinde elementler metal, yarı metal ve ametal olmalarına göre üç farklı renkle boyanmıştır. Renklerin hangi sınıfı gösterdiği verilmemiştir. Soy gazlar ametallerle aynı renkte gösterilmiştir. 3. periyot 13. gruptaki <b>X</b> elementinin kutusu ise boyanmadan bırakılmıştır.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 156\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Renkli periyodik tablo kesiti; renklerin anlamı verilmemiş; 3. periyot 13. gruptaki X boyanmamış\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"36\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"516\" y=\"36\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#475569\" font-weight=\"bold\">1.</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"64\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"68\" y=\"64\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"376\" y=\"64\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"404\" y=\"64\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"432\" y=\"64\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"460\" y=\"64\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"488\" y=\"64\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"516\" y=\"64\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#475569\" font-weight=\"bold\">2.</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"92\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"68\" y=\"92\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"376\" y=\"92\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"111\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">X</text><rect x=\"404\" y=\"92\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"432\" y=\"92\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"460\" y=\"92\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"488\" y=\"92\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"516\" y=\"92\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#475569\" font-weight=\"bold\">3.</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"390\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" font-weight=\"bold\">13</text><text x=\"418\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" font-weight=\"bold\">14</text><text x=\"446\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" font-weight=\"bold\">15</text><text x=\"474\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" font-weight=\"bold\">16</text><text x=\"502\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" font-weight=\"bold\">17</text><text x=\"530\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" font-weight=\"bold\">18</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">Grup numaraları</text><text x=\"4\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#475569\">Periyot</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"129\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"116\" y=\"143\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\">1. renk</text><rect x=\"240\" y=\"129\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"266\" y=\"143\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\">2. renk</text><rect x=\"390\" y=\"129\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"416\" y=\"143\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\">3. renk</text></svg></div><p>Buna göre X elementinin kutusu hangi elementlerle <b>aynı renge</b> boyanmalıdır?</p>",
